<title>USA: Tribune unit orders Harris transmitters.</title>
<headline>Tribune unit orders Harris transmitters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tribune Broadcasting Co, a Tribune Co unit, said Wednesday it signed an agreement for Harris Corp to provide digital and analog television transmitters for its owned stations throughout the United States.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tribune Broadcasting owns stations in most of the nation's largest markets, from New York to Chicago to Los Angeles.</p>
<p>Harris is an international communications and electronics company.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
